    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="54.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 54.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Witeðeowne monnan wyliscne mon sceal bedrifan be XII hidum swa ðeowne to swingum, Engliscne be feower ⁊ XXX hida.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A Welshman in the position of penal slave shall be forced to be lashed like a slave [by an oath of] twelve hides; an Englishman by [an oath of] thirty-four hides.1</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">A Welshman, who has been reduced to penal slavery, shall be compelled to submit to a scourging, as a slave, by [an oath of] 12 hides; an Englishman, by [an oath of] 34 hides.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Witeðeowne mon Wiliscne mon sceal bedrifan be XII hidum swa ðeowne to swingum, Engliscne be XXXIIII hida.</ab>
      </div>
